              <button class="ca-back" id="caReset" hidden>◂ BACK TO STARS</button>
            </p>
            <svg id="caMap" viewBox="0 0 420 460" aria-label="Bipartite map of seven coded themes and eight participants; edge thickness is the number of tagged moments; click a node to filter"></svg>
          </div>
